<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1 Johana</book>
  <para style="h">1 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Johana</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Johana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tîr aṭanga awm, kan benga kan hriat, kan mita kan hmuh, ngun taka kan en, kuta kan khawih, nunna thu chu kan ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu nunna chu a lo lang a, kan hmu ta a, kan puang a, Pa hnêna awm chatuan nunna kan hnêna lo lang ta chu kan hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangnin min pâwl ve theih nân kan hmuh leh kan hriat chu kan hrilh che u a, chu kan inpâwlna chu Pa leh Fapa Isua Krista nêna kan inpâwlna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan lâwm a famkim theih nân hêng thu hi kan ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuchah a hnên ata kan hriat kan hrilh chhâwn che u chu hei hi a ni: Pathian chu êng a ni a, amahah chuan thim rêng a awm lo tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amah nên kan inpâwl,” kan tiha, thima kan awm si chuan dâwt kan sawi a, thutak kan zâwm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah ênga a awm angin ênga kan awm ve erawh chuan, kan inpâwl ho va, A Fapa Isua thisenin kan sual zawng zawng min tlen faisak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sual ka nei lo,” kan tih chuan mahni kan inbum a, thutak chu keimahniah a awm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan sualte kan puan erawh chuan, ani chu a rinawmin a dik si a, kan sualte min ngaidamin kan dik lohna zawng zawng min tlen faisak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Thil sual ka ti lo,” kan tih chuan ani chu dawtheiah kan chantîr a, a thu pawh keimahniah a awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Fate u, thil sual in tih loh nân hêng thu hi in hnênah ka ziak a nih hi. Amaherawhchu, tu pawh lo sual ta sela, Pa hnêna min sawipuitu mi fel, Isua Krista chu kan nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chu kan sual ngaihdamna a ni, keimahni sual chauh ni lovin, khawvêla mi zawng zawng sual ngaihdamna pawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thupêkte kan zawm chuan amah kan hria a ni tih kan chiang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Amah chu ka hria,” tia a thupêkte zâwm si lo chu mi dawthei a ni a, amahah thutak a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu pawhin a thu a zawm chuan Pathian chu a hmangaih takzet a ni. Amahah kan awm ngei tih hriat chianna tûr chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amahah ka awm reng, titu chu Krista nun angin a nung ve tûr a ni,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Duh takte u, in hnênah thupêk thar ka han ziak a ni lo ve, thupêk hlui, a tîr ata in neih kha ka ziak a ni zâwk e. Thupêk hlui chu thu, in hriat tawh sa kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In hnêna thupêk ka ziak hi a thar a nihna a awm bawk, amahah leh nangmahniah a dikzia a lang; thim chu a kiang mêk a, êng tak tak a lo ên tâk avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ênga awm intia, a unau haw si chu tûn thlengin thimah a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahni unau hmangaihtu chu êngah a awm reng a, a tân tlûk a hlauhawm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahni unau hawtu erawh chu thimah a awm a, thimah a vâk vêl a, thimin a mit a tihdel tawh avângin a kalna pawh a hre ṭhîn lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fate u, ama hming avânga in sualte ngaihdam a nih tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pate u, a tîr ata awm renga chu in hriat tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a nih hi. Tlangvâlte u, mi sual chu in ngam tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naute u, Pa chu in hriat tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a ni. Pate u, a tîr ata awm renga chu in hriat tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a ni. Tlangvâlte u, in chak a, Pathian thu nangmahniah a awm avânga mi sual in ngam tâk avângin in hnênah ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khawvêl hi hmangaih suh ula, khawvêla thil awmte pawh hmangaih hek suh u. Tu pawhin khawvêl hi a hmangaih chuan, Pa chu a hmangaih lo va ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khawvêla thil awm zawng zawng - tisa châkna te, mit châkna te, mahni sum uanpuina te hi Pa hnên aṭanga chhuak a ni lo va, khawvêl aṭanga chhuak a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawvêl hi a châknate chawpin a boral mêk a ni. Pathian duh zâwng titu erawh chu kum khuain a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naute u, hun hnuhnûng a lo ni ta a, Krista dodâltu a lo kal dâwn tih in hriat ang khân, tûnah hian Krista dodâltu tam tak an lo chhuak ta; chuvâng chuan, hun hnuhnûng chu a ni tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chu kan zîng ata an chhuak a, kan mi leh sa tak tak an ni lo rêng a, ni se kan zîngah an awm reng tûr. Mahse, an za-in kan mi leh sa an ni vek lo tih a lan chian nân an chhuak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangni zawng, Mi Thianghlima chuan hriak a thih che u a, engkim in hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thutak chu in hriat loh avânga in hnêna ziak ka ni lo; in hriat avâng leh thutak aṭanga dâwt a chhuah ngai loh avânga ziak ka ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua chu Krista a ni tih pawm lotu aliama dawthei tu nge awm? Pa leh Fapa pawm lotu chu Krista dodâltu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh Fapa pawm lo chuan Pa pawh a pawm lo va ni: Fapa pawmtu erawh chuan Pa pawh a pawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangni zawngin a tîr ata in hriat kha nangmahniah awmtîr reng rawh u. A tîr ata in hriat kha nangmahniah a awm reng chuan, nangni pawh Paah leh Fapaah chuan in awm reng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hei hi a ni, a thutiam, amah ngeiin kan hnêna a tiam chu - chutuan nunna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangmahni hruai bo tumtute chungchâng thu hi in hnênah ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangni thu-ah zawng, a hriak thih che u kha nangmahniah a awm reng a, tu ma zirtîr in ngai lo ve, a hriak thihna che u chuan thil tinrêng a zirtîr zâwk che u a, chu chu a dik a, dâwt a ni lo. Tichuan, a zirtîr che u ang khân amahah awm reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tûnah hian, fate u, a rawn inlâr huna huai taka kan awma, a lo kal hunah zak lova kan awm theih nân amahah awm reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amah chu mi dik tak a ni tih in hriat chuan, dik taka titu apiang chu a fate an ni tih hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Pain min lo va hmangaih nasa êm; Pathian fa-ahte min vuah tâk hi! Chutiang chu kan ni rêng e. Hemi avâng hian khawvêlin min hre lo va ni, amah chu an hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Duh takte u, tûnah hian Pathian fate kan ni tawh reng a, engtin nge kan la awm dâwn tih erawh chu a lang rih lo va. Amah a lo lan hun chuan amah ang kan la ni ang tih zawng kan hria, a nih ang takin amah chu kan la hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kristaa chutiang beiseina nei apiang chuan amah a thianghlim angin a intithianghlim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu pawh thil sual ti chuan dân a bawhchhia a ni, sual chu dân bawhchhiatna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chu sualte la bo tûrin a lo lang a, amahah chuan sual a awm lo tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu pawh amaha awm reng chuan thil sual a ti lo; tu pawh thil sual ti chuan amah a hmu lo va, hriat pawh a hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Fate u, tu man bum che u suh se; ani chu mi dik tak a ni ang khân thil dik titu chu mi dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil sual titu chu Diabola aṭanga chhuak a ni; a tîr aṭang rêngin Diabola chuan thil sual a ti si a. Pathian Fapa lo lan chhan chu, Diabola hnathawhte tiboral tûr hian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian hrin chuan, Pathian chi chu amahah a awm reng avângin thil sual a ti lo; Pathian hrin a nih avângin sual pawh a sual thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian fate leh Diabola fate lan chianna chu hei hi a ni: Tu pawh thil dik ti lo leh a unau hmangaih lo chu Pathiana chhuak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tîr ata thuchah in hriat kha hei hi a ni, kan inhmangaih tawn ṭheuh tûr a ni, tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sual laka chhuak, Kaina, a unau thattu ang kha kan ni tûr a ni lo. Eng vângin nge a thah le? Ama thiltihte a sual a, a nau thiltihte a dik avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, khawvêlin a huat che u pawhin mak ti suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keini chuan unaute kan hmangaih avângin thihna ata kan chhuak a, nunnaah kan lût tawh tih kan hria: hmangaihna nei lo chu thihnaah a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu pawh a unau hua chu tual that a ni, tu pawh tual that chuan chatuan nun a nei dâwn lo tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anin kan tân a nun a pêkah hian hmangaihna chu kan hre ta. Keini pawhin unaute tân kan nun kan pe ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in emaw khawvêl hausakna neiin a unau tlachham hmu sela, amah chu lainat si lo sela. Pathian hmangaihna chu engtin nge amahah a awm theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fate u, ṭawngka leh thu chauhvin i hmangaih suh ang u, thiltih leh tihtakzetin ni zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, thutakah kan awm tih kan inhria ang a, a hmaah pawh tlângnêl takin kan awm thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan thinlung mahin thiam loh min chantîr chuan, Pathian chu kan thinlung aiin a ropui zâwk a, engkim a hre vek a ni tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Duh takte u, kan rilruin thiam loh min chantîr loh chuan Pathian kan nêl ngam ṭhîn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a thupêk kan zawma a lâwmzâwng kan tih avângin, a hnêna kan dîl apiang kan hmu zêl ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thupêk chu hei hi a ni: A Fapa Isua Krista hming kan rina, thu min pêk anga kan inhmangaih tawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian thupêk zâwmtu chu Pathianah a awm reng a, Pathian pawh amahah a awm reng a ni. Tin, hei hi Pathian keimahniah a awm reng tih kan hriatna a ni: Thlarau min pêk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Duh takte u, thlarau nazawng ring zêl suh u, thlarau chu Pathian aṭanga lo chhuak a ni nge ni lo fiah ṭhîn zâwk rawh u; zâwlnei der tam tak khawvêlah an lo chhuah tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hei hi Pathian Thlarau in hriat theihna tûr chu a ni: Isua Krista chu tisain a lo kal tih ṭantu apiangin Thlarau a dawn chu Pathiana chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isua ṭan lote thlarau dawn chu Pathian aṭanga chhuak a ni lo thung: chu chu Krista dodâltu, a lo kal dâwn tih in hriat lâwk kha a ni, tûnah pawh khawvêlah a awm tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fate u, nangni chu Pathian aṭanga chhuak in ni a, nangmahnia awma chu khawvêla awma ai chuan a ropui zâwk avângin zâwlnei derte chu in ngam tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu khawvêla mi an ni a; chuvângin, khawvêla mi angin thu an sawi a, khawvêlin an thu an ngaithla ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keini zawng Pathian aṭanga chhuak kan ni a; Pathian hretute chuan kan thu pawh an ngaithla ṭhîn; Pathian aṭanga chhuak lo chuan kan thu pawh an ngaithla lo; chûng aṭang chuan thlarau dik tak leh thlarau dik lo kan hre thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Duh takte u, i inhmangaih tawn teh ang u; hmangaihna chu Pathian aṭanga lo chhuak a ni si a; tu pawh hmangaihna nei chu Pathian hrin an ni a, Pathian an hre bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmangaihna nei lo erawh chuan Pathian an hre lo, Pathian chu hmangaihna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian hmangaihna chu hetiang hian kan zîngah a lo lang, a zâra nun kan neih theihna tûrin Pathianin a Fapa neih chhun khawvêla a rawn tirhah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hei ngei hi a ni hmangaihna chu: Keinin Pathian kan hmangaih ni lovin, Aman min hmangaih a, kan sual thupha chawi nân a Fapa a rawn tîr ta zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duh takte u, Pathianin chuti taka min hmangaih si chuan, keini pawh kan inhmangaih tawn ṭheuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu man Pathian an hmu ngai lo na a, kan inhmangaih tawn chuan Pathian keimahniah a awm reng a, a hmangaihna pawh keimahniah tihfamkimin a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A Thlarau min pêk hi, Amahah kan awma, Ani pawh keimahniah a awm tih kan hriatna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pain Fapa chu khawvêl Chhandamtu atân a rawn tîr tih kan hmu tawh a, mi dang pawh kan hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu pawh Isua chu Pathian Fapa a ni tih ṭantu chu amahah Pathian a awm reng a, ani pawh chu Pathianah a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin min hmangaihna chu keimahni ngeiin kan hria a, kan ring ta a ni. Pathian chu hmangaihna a ni a, chu hmangaihnaa awm reng chu Pathianah a awm reng a, Pathian pawh amahah a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rorêl ni-a hlau hlek lova kan awm theih nân keimahniah hmangaihna chu tihfamkim a ni ta; he khawvêlah pawh hian amah ang takin kan awm tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmangaihnaah hian hlauhna rêng a awm lo va, hmangaihna famkim chuan hlauhna zawng zawng a hnawt bo zâwk ṭhîn. Hlauhnaah hian hremna a tel a, hlauva awm chu hmangaihnaah a la famkim lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman min hmangaih hmasak avângin keini pawhin kan hmangaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin “Pathian ka hmangaih,” tiin a unau haw si se, mi dawthei a ni; a unau a hmuh renga mah a hmangaih si loh chuan, Pathian a hmuh ngai loh chu a hmangaih thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />He thupêk hi a hnên aṭangin kan hmu a ni: Pathian hmangaihtu chuan a unau pawh a hmangaih tûr a ni, tih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua hi Krista chu a ni tih ring apiang chu Pathian hrin a ni, a hringtu hmangaihtu chuan a hrina pawh a hmangaih ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian fate kan hmangaih a ni tih kan hriatna chu, Pathian kan hmangaih a, a thupêkte kan zawm hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kan hmangaih vena chu hei hi a ni: a thupêkte kan zawm hi; a thupêkte chu a khirh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian hrin tawh phawt chuan khawvêl hi a ngam ṭhîn: hei hi a ni, khawvêl hneha ngamna chu, kan rinna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua hi Pathian Fapa a ni tih ringtu chauh lo chuan tu nge khawvêl ngam ṭhîn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isua Krista hi a ni, tui leh thisena lo kala chu, tuiah chauh ni lovin, tuiah leh thlarauvah a ni zâwk e; thlarau chu hriatpuitu a ni. Thlarau chu thutak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hriatpuitu pathum an awm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlarau leh tui leh thisen chu, chûng pathumte chu an inthurual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihring hriatpuina mah kan pawm chuan Pathian hriatpuina chu a ropui zâwk si a; Pathian hriatpuina chu, A Fapa chanchin a hriattîr tâkna hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian Fapa ringtu chuan amahah he hriatna hi a nei a ni: Pathian ring lotu erawh chuan Pathian chu dawtheiah a chantîr a ni, Pathianin Fapa chanchin a hriattîr chu a rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hei hi a thu hriattîr chu a ni - Pathian chuan chatuan nun min pe a, chu nun chu Fapaah hian a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fapa nei apiang chuan nunna chu an nei, Fapa nei lo erawh chuan nunna chu an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatuan nun in nei tih in hriat theih nân nangni Pathian Fapa hming ringtute hnênah hêng thu hi ka ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A duh zâwng anga eng pawh kan dîl chuan min ngaihthlâksak ṭhîn, chu chu amah kan nêl chhan chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan dîl apiangin min ngaithla ṭhîn tih kan hriat avângin, kan dîl ang chu min pe ṭhîn tih pawh kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu pawhin a unau, thihna khawp ni lo sual tiin hmu sela, a dîlsak ang a, Pathianin nunna a pe ang. Hei hi thihna khawp sual ti lote tân a ni. Thihna khawp sual a awm a, chutiang tân dîlsak tûr ka ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thil dik lo tih zawng zawng hi sual a ni vek a; amaherawhchu, sual apiang hi thihna khawp sual a ni vek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian hrin chuan thil a tisual lo tih kan hria; Pathian Hrina khân a vawng him a, mi sual chuan a khawih thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawvêl pum hi Misualpa thuhnuaiah awm mah se, Pathian aṭanga chhuak kan ni tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian Fapa chu a lo kal a, Pathian tak chu hre thei tûrin hriat theihna min rawn pe tih kan hre bawk; tichuan, Pathian takah chuan kan awm a ni - a Fapa Isua Kristaah chuan. Hei hi a ni Pathian dik tak chu, hei hi a ni chatuan nunna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fate u, milem lakah invêng ṭha rawh u.
  </para>
</usx>
